{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"fc14228a0294158a","type":"text","text":"MCP：  大模型更好的使用工具的协议","x":-480,"y":-180,"width":199,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"4b235f6930853c0a","type":"text","text":"MCP就是一段程序而已,MCP的底层和语言无关","x":-880,"y":-180,"width":200,"height":100},
		{"id":"0046876fda014fe4","type":"text","text":"MCP市场\n```bat\nhttps://glama.ai/mcp/servers\n```\n```bat\nhttps://smithery.ai/\n```\n","x":-1020,"y":70,"width":405,"height":200},
		{"id":"13a6dbfdb746635a","type":"text","text":"大部分MCP是通过node.js或者python启动的","x":-100,"y":-165,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"776319c4eae33c53","type":"text","text":"建立一个属于自己的MCP具体过程，这是第一次开发的时候需要这样做，如果后面换了一个环境的话\n1.建立项目文件夹\n```bat\nmkdir E:\\Vscode_codes\\mcp_test \ncd /d E:\\Vscode_codes\\mcp_test\n uv init uv venv\n  .venv\\Scripts\\activate.bat\n   uv add \"mcp[cli]\" httpx \n   python -c \"import mcp, httpx; print('MCP 环境配置成功')\" \n   mcp --help\n```\n","x":-20,"y":60,"width":800,"height":300},
		{"id":"cc6039e62808fc3d","type":"text","text":"Python-->uvx\nnode.js-->npx","x":-480,"y":70,"width":200,"height":100},
		{"id":"18d1fd538478683d","type":"text","text":"uv就是python的一个包管理软件","x":-605,"y":330,"width":200,"height":100},
		{"id":"be947bfbf774f0a5","type":"text","text":"node.js","x":-355,"y":330,"width":200,"height":100},
		{"id":"37fdd226eacbb841","type":"text","text":"第二次打开，来开发的话\n```bat\ncd /d E:\\Vscode_codes\\mcp_test\nuv run python main.py\n```","x":-20,"y":440,"width":800,"height":180},
		{"id":"b636beb6a2c045ae","type":"text","text":"大模型","x":2300,"y":-77,"width":111,"height":60},
		{"id":"226c387c87ca63d4","type":"text","text":"大模型","x":2300,"y":83,"width":111,"height":60},
		{"id":"c0e0843959d895df","type":"text","text":"大模型的作用：1.告诉平台用什么工具；2.将最后的结果总结归纳呈现给用户","x":2471,"y":-222,"width":266,"height":85,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"57b3aee5e6ee4812","type":"text","text":"平台：串联流程；调用工具","x":2471,"y":-137,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
